            "text": "Ok.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M10",
            "speaker_id": 373940,
            "reply_to": "M6",
            "text": "Great. Now for T2, I've drafted an initial move sequence and routing plan for a pilot using just Zone C. It's in the second tab of A1. The plan is to use the back corridor to avoid the main floor during the morning rush. Please review and let me know if you see any issues.",
            "mentions": [
              538335,
              221215,
              216869,
              62106
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T2",
              "A1"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M11",
            "speaker_id": 538335,
            "reply_to": "M10",
            "text": "The back corridor route is smart. It's narrower, so we'll need to be precise with the forklift, but it completely avoids conflict with outbound staging. The proposed time window (11:00-14:00) is also good. I've checked the schedule and it's a low-activity period.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "thumbsup",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M12",
            "speaker_id": 221215,
            "reply_to": "M10",
            "text": "The plan in A1 looks solid. The steps are clear. Do we need a spotter for the tight corners in the back corridor?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A1"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M13",
            "speaker_id": 373940,
            "reply_to": "M12",
            "text": "Good point. Yes, let's make that a requirement. I'll add a note to the plan in A1. Safety first.",
            "mentions": [],
