              "A1"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M14",
            "speaker_id": 62106,
            "reply_to": "M10",
            "text": "The route makes sense. What about the weight capacity of the flooring in that corridor? I remember there was some concern about that a while back.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M15",
            "speaker_id": 538335,
            "reply_to": "M14",
            "text": "I checked with maintenance this morning. The floor was reinforced last year and is rated for our heaviest forklift plus its max load. We're clear on that front.",
