      {
        "thread_id": "TH2",
        "thread_goal": "Define and agree on safety procedures and equipment checks.",
        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M19",
            "speaker_id": 373940,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Alright team, let's focus on safety. I've drafted two key documents. First is A2, the SOP for handling dangerous goods, which covers T4. Second is A3, the pre-use equipment checklist for forklifts and cranes, for T5. Please review them and provide feedback.",
            "mentions": [
              538335,
              221215,
              216869,
              62106
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A2",
              "A3",
              "T4",
              "T5"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M20",
            "speaker_id": 538335,
            "reply_to": "M19",
            "text": "Thanks for putting these together. A3 looks comprehensive. Making this a mandatory check before every shift is non-negotiable. It will prevent most of the common equipment-related incidents.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A3"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "heavy_check_mark",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M21",
            "speaker_id": 62106,
            "reply_to": "M19",
            "text": "In A2, section 3, it mentions specific strapping techniques for cylindrical containers. My mechatronics training covered this, and I think we should specify using two straps with opposing buckles to prevent rolling. The current text is a bit vague.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A2"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M22",
            "speaker_id": 373940,
            "reply_to": "M21",
            "text": "That's a great catch, exactly the kind of detail we need. I've updated A2 with that specific instruction. Thanks.",
            "mentions": [
              62106
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A2"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "thumbsup",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M23",
            "speaker_id": 221215,
            "reply_to": "M19",
            "text": "Both documents look good. For A3, where will the physical copies be kept? Should be right on the machines so nobody can miss them.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A3"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M24",
            "speaker_id": 538335,
            "reply_to": "M23",
            "text": "Agreed. We'll put laminated copies in a pouch attached to each piece of equipment. The completed forms go into a binder in the supervisor's office at the end of the shift.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M25",
            "speaker_id": 216869,
            "reply_to": "M19",
            "text": "What if we find a problem on the checklist A3?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A3"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M26",
            "speaker_id": 373940,
            "reply_to": "M25",
            "text": "If any item on the checklist fails, the equipment is immediately tagged 'Out of Service' and you report it to the shift supervisor and maintenance. Do not operate it. I'll add this instruction explicitly to the bottom of A3.",
            "mentions": [
              216869
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A3"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "ok",
