      {
        "thread_id": "TH4",
        "thread_goal": "Run the pilot relocation, capture issues, and agree on improvements.",
        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M48",
            "speaker_id": 373940,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Team, we are starting the pilot relocation of Zone C now (T7). The plan is in A1. Please be vigilant about safety and efficiency. Remember to log any incidents or near-misses in A5 as per T10. Let's share feedback here as well.",
            "mentions": [
              538335,
              221215,
              216869,
              62106
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T7",
              "A1",
              "A5",
              "T10"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "rocket",
                "count": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M49",
            "speaker_id": 221215,
            "reply_to": "M48",
            "text": "Just a heads-up, the back corridor route is tighter than it looks on the map. We had to do a three-point turn with the forklift on the corner near the maintenance closet. It slowed us down by about 10 minutes. No safety issue, just an efficiency note.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M50",
            "speaker_id": 538335,
            "reply_to": "M49",
            "text": "Good feedback. We should note that in the plan for larger loads. I've also logged a near-miss in A5: someone from another department walked through our cordoned-off area. We need better physical barriers for the full rollout, not just tape.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A5"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M51",
            "speaker_id": 216869,
            "reply_to": "M48",
            "text": "one of the boxes was not sealed right. some stuff almost fell out.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M52",
            "speaker_id": 373940,
            "reply_to": "M51",
            "text": "Thanks for flagging. Was it one of our repacked boxes or an existing one? We need to add a 'check package integrity' step to our pre-move checklist.",
            "mentions": [
              216869
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M53",
            "speaker_id": 216869,
            "reply_to": "M52",
            "text": "it was an old one. ok i will remember to check next time.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M54",
            "speaker_id": 373940,
            "reply_to": "M48",
            "text": "Update: Pilot move for Zone C is complete. Total time was 2.5 hours, within our 3-hour window. I've compiled all the feedback from here and the logs into the A7 lessons learned summary. Please take a look.",
            "mentions": [
              538335,
              221215,
              216869,
              62106
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A7"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "tada",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M55",
            "speaker_id": 538335,
            "reply_to": "M54",
            "text": "Nice work everyone. Reading through A7, the main takeaways are: need for better barriers, a pre-move package check, and accounting for slower speeds in tight corridors. Overall, the process worked. I think the approach is acceptable for a full rollout, provided we make these changes.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A7"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D6"
            ],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M56",
            "speaker_id": 221215,
            "reply_to": "M55",
            "text": "I agree. With those adjustments, we should be much smoother for the next zones.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
